## COMMON QUESTIONS

**Q: Can I run this on my laptop?**
A: Yes! Low CPU usage (<5%), minimal RAM. Cloud hosting optional.

**Q: What if Hyperliquid goes down?**
A: Your funds are on-chain. Switch to another DEX or wait for recovery. Bot can integrate other exchanges (Binance, Bybit).

**Q: How much can I make?**
A: Realistic: 8-15% monthly. Don't expect 100%+ returns - that's unsustainable.

**Q: When should I increase leverage?**
A: Only after 4+ weeks of profitable operation. Start at 1x, increase to 2x, then 3x max.

**Q: Will it work in bear markets?**
A: Yes! Bot trades shorts too. Actually performs better in trending down markets.

**Q: How often does bot trade?**
A: Depends on settings. Default: 5-20 trades per day. Can adjust via confirmation count.

